::  mar/furum/msg: what ships send each other's inboxes: an action on a
::  board, a registry action, a note ($msg in lib/furum-types). A noun
::  passthrough: the receiving writer clams it under mule, so a malformed
::  one is dropped rather than a fuse blown.
::
|_  n=*
++  grad  %noun
++  grow
  |%
  ++  noun  n
  --
++  grab
  |%
  ++  noun  *
  --
--
